<title>BELGIUM: CREYF'S H1 1996 GROUP NET UP SIX PCT.</title>
<headline>CREYF'S H1 1996 GROUP NET UP SIX PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit	   48  vs    45</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	    56  vs   n/a</p>
<p>    Sales (bln)		3.66  vs  3.00</p>
<p>    Cons extraordinary gain  11  vs     0</p>
<p>    Cons current profit *    90  vs   100</p>
<p>NOTE - Creyf's NV is a temporary employment agency</p>
<p>with units in Belgium, Luxembourg and northern France.</p>
<p>* Cons current before amortization of goodwill</p>
</text>
